WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.570 --> 00:00:04.570
Galactic showdowns, new Marvel heroes, and…
chipmunks?

00:00:04.570 --> 00:00:08.290
Here's why 2022 is set to be a buck wild year
for Disney+

00:00:09.679 --> 00:00:14.200
Remember when Ice Age was 20th Century Fox's
answer to the movies of Pixar and Dreamworks?

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:19.360
Well, now that Fox is owned by Disney, the
studio's coolest animated franchise is making

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:21.010
its way to Disney+.

00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:25.839
Ice Age: Adventures of Buck Wild is the next
feature film in the Ice Age saga, following

00:00:25.839 --> 00:00:30.769
possum brothers Crash and Eddie as they team
up with Buck Wild, a rowdy weasel.

00:00:30.769 --> 00:00:35.210
The unlikely trio must traverse the Lost World
to save themselves from the dinosaurs now

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:36.410
roaming the land.

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:41.550
Ice Age: Adventures of Buck Wild will premiere
on Disney+ on January 28.

00:00:42.550 --> 00:00:46.730
Sneakerella is a musical modernization of
the classic Cinderella fairy tale.

00:00:46.730 --> 00:00:52.910
Disney infamously remade the story in live-action
form in 2015, while in 2021, Amazon released

00:00:52.910 --> 00:00:57.160
a jukebox musical version of the tale starring
Camila Cabello.

00:00:57.160 --> 00:01:01.789
Meanwhile, Sneakerella stars a predominantly
Black and gender-swapped cast, while shifting

00:01:01.789 --> 00:01:05.090
the story's time and place to modern day Queens,
New York.

00:01:05.090 --> 00:01:10.060
The movie finds aspiring shoe designer Zelly
falling in love with Kira, the daughter of

00:01:10.060 --> 00:01:13.750
basketball star and sneaker tycoon Darius
King.

00:01:13.750 --> 00:01:18.190
This mash-up of age-old love story and modern
sneaker culture will likely appeal to all

00:01:18.190 --> 00:01:21.890
kinds of viewers — and it's coming to Disney+
on February 18.

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:28.570
The original Proud Family series ran for two
seasons, beginning in 2001 and wrapping up

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:30.430
its run in 2005.

00:01:30.430 --> 00:01:35.570
The capstone on the series was a Disney Channel
Original, The Proud Family Movie, which served

00:01:35.570 --> 00:01:37.690
as a finale for the whole series.

00:01:37.690 --> 00:01:42.350
Much of the original voice cast is returning
to The Proud Family: Louder and Prouder, including

00:01:48.782 --> 00:01:53.543
up by a 2D animated series spinoff that ran
from 2017 until 2021.

00:01:53.543 --> 00:01:58.663
Now, though, Disney+ has been chosen as the
home for the film and show's most popular

00:01:58.663 --> 00:01:59.772
character: Baymax.

00:01:59.772 --> 00:02:00.883
"Hairy baby!

00:02:00.883 --> 00:02:05.613
Hairy… baby."

00:02:05.613 --> 00:02:09.663
Returning to the 3D art style of the movie,
the first trailer for Baymax!

00:02:09.663 --> 00:02:12.913
Suggests that the inflatable white robot is
up to his old hijinks.

00:02:12.913 --> 00:02:16.713
The only difference here is that it appears
that Hiro and the rest of the Big Hero 6 crew

00:02:16.713 --> 00:02:18.823
might not be making an appearance.

00:02:18.823 --> 00:02:23.573
Whether or not these characters do return,
Baymax! is set to make his comeback on Disney+

00:02:23.573 --> 00:02:26.553
in the summer of 2022.

00:02:26.693 --> 00:02:30.463
Cheaper by the Dozen is a franchise that has
been going for much longer than you might

00:02:30.463 --> 00:02:31.463
think.

00:02:31.463 --> 00:02:35.773
Take this new remake, for example, which is
the second proper reboot of the original 1950

00:02:35.773 --> 00:02:36.773
comedy.

00:02:36.773 --> 00:02:40.863
Any decent Cheaper by the Dozen movie needs
to nail down the perfect adult cast to take

00:02:40.863 --> 00:02:45.933
on those kids, of course, and the latest movie
seems to have pulled it off, with Zach Braff

00:02:45.933 --> 00:02:48.803
and Gabrielle Union starring as the parents.

00:02:48.803 --> 00:02:53.613
The reboot is being directed by Gail Lerner,
who has served as a producer on such TV series

00:02:53.613 --> 00:02:56.533
as Will and Grace and, more recently, Black-ish.

00:02:56.533 --> 00:03:01.488
Cheaper by the Dozen will stream on Disney+
in March 2022.

00:03:01.883 --> 00:03:05.343
Black Rock Shooter: Dawn Fall will be a first
for Disney+.

00:03:05.343 --> 00:03:09.913
This reboot of the popular anime is streaming
exclusively on the service in the US at the

00:03:09.913 --> 00:03:14.923
same time it will be airing on Japanese TV,
starting in April 2022.

00:03:14.923 --> 00:03:19.213
The series follows the Black Rock Shooter,
an enigmatic blue-eyed, black-haired girl

00:03:19.213 --> 00:03:24.063
who appears in wildly different worlds and
scenarios across the franchise's media.

00:03:24.063 --> 00:03:28.643
Dawn Fall is the latest take on the character,
and will stream on Disney+ in an attempt to

00:03:28.643 --> 00:03:32.013
move the service towards more Asia-Pacific
original content.

00:03:32.013 --> 00:03:35.373
Could it kick off a whole new era in Disney
programming?

00:03:35.373 --> 00:03:36.373
Only time will tell.

00:03:37.373 --> 00:03:41.863
Featuring two mischievous yet lovable chipmunks,
the original Rescue Rangers series aired in

00:03:41.863 --> 00:03:43.663
1989 and 1990.

00:03:43.663 --> 00:03:48.503
The show lived on through reruns on Disney
channels in the 2000s, eventually leading

00:03:48.503 --> 00:03:52.093
to the development of a live-action movie
with CGI chipmunks.

00:03:52.093 --> 00:03:56.563
The Chip 'n Dale Rescue Rangers movie has
been in the works since 2014, but it looks

00:03:56.563 --> 00:03:58.663
like it'll be well worth the wait.

00:03:58.663 --> 00:04:03.603
With John Mulaney voicing Chip and Andy Samberg
as Dale, the movie certainly has its talent

00:04:03.603 --> 00:04:04.603
on lock.

00:04:04.603 --> 00:04:09.703
Famed voice actor Corey Burton is also returning
to reprise his role as Zipper, the starry-eyed

00:04:09.703 --> 00:04:12.213
fly who acts as the third member of the Rangers.

00:04:12.213 --> 00:04:18.143
Chip 'n Dale Rescue Rangers will be released
on Disney+ in the spring of 2022.

00:04:18.143 --> 00:04:22.503
Better Nate Than Ever is an upcoming original
musical based on the 2013 young adult novel

00:04:22.503 --> 00:04:23.863
by Tim Federle.

00:04:23.863 --> 00:04:28.613
The book is an empathetic exploration of the
lives of theatre kids, including 13-year-old

00:04:28.613 --> 00:04:33.433
Nate Foster, who escapes his midwestern life
by sneaking off to New York City to audition

00:04:33.433 --> 00:04:34.903
for a Broadway show.

00:04:34.903 --> 00:04:36.563
In the novel, that show is E.T.

00:04:36.563 --> 00:04:41.403
The Musical, a genuinely fun choice that the
movie adaptation will hopefully follow.

00:04:41.403 --> 00:04:45.923
Friends star Lisa Kudrow has also been cast
as Nate's long-lost aunt Heidi.

00:04:45.923 --> 00:04:51.187
Better Nate Than Ever is set for release on
Disney+ in the spring of 2022.

00:04:51.613 --> 00:04:56.393
Unlike many of Disney's other live-action
remakes, the studio's latest so-called "reimagining"

00:04:56.393 --> 00:04:59.002
is due to be a Disney+ exclusive.

00:04:59.002 --> 00:05:04.233
Streaming at some point in 2022, a live-action
remake of Pinocchio is next on the slate.

00:05:04.233 --> 00:05:09.123
The project is being directed by Robert Zemeckis,
who is best known for helming Forrest Gump,

00:05:09.123 --> 00:05:13.033
Who Framed Roger Rabbit?, and Back to the
Future.

00:05:13.033 --> 00:05:16.423
"Great Scott!"

00:05:16.423 --> 00:05:20.953
This retelling of the classic story comes
courtesy of an all-star cast led by Tom Hanks

00:05:20.953 --> 00:05:24.553
as Geppetto and Cynthia Erivo as the Blue
Fairy.

00:05:24.553 --> 00:05:28.643
Certain characters will still be animated,
including Jiminy Cricket, who will be voiced

00:05:28.643 --> 00:05:29.753
by Joseph Gordon-Levitt.

00:05:29.753 --> 00:05:35.253
Meanwhile, The Haunting of Bly Manor's Benjamin
Evan Ainsworth is playing the titular puppet.

00:05:35.253 --> 00:05:39.754
Pinocchio will stream on Disney+ in the fall
of 2022.

00:05:39.943 --> 00:05:44.103
A modern classic in the Disney musical canon,
Enchanted was well received as a parody of

00:05:44.103 --> 00:05:48.453
classic princess stories and a pretty great
movie in its own right — so the lack of

00:05:48.453 --> 00:05:51.413
an immediate follow-up came as something of
a surprise.

00:05:51.413 --> 00:05:56.163
Well, Enchanted fans won't have to wait any
longer, as the long-awaited sequel Disenchanted

00:05:56.163 --> 00:05:58.293
is on its way to Disney+.

00:05:58.293 --> 00:06:03.073
Most of the original cast are returning for
Disenchanted, including Amy Adams as Giselle,

00:06:03.073 --> 00:06:07.243
while acclaimed Disney musicians Alan Menken
and Stephen Schwartz will be providing the

00:06:07.243 --> 00:06:09.813
compositions and lyrics respectively.

00:06:09.813 --> 00:06:14.287
Disenchanted arrives on Disney+ in the fall
of 2022.

00:06:14.583 --> 00:06:19.393
Hocus Pocus is a Halloween classic now beloved
by millennial Disney fans, but it wasn't a

00:06:19.393 --> 00:06:21.443
huge hit during its box office run.

00:06:21.443 --> 00:06:25.363
In the years since, however, the movie has
gained a significant cult following.

00:06:25.363 --> 00:06:30.043
Of course, this wouldn't be a proper Hocus
Pocus sequel without Sarah Jessica Parker,

00:06:30.043 --> 00:06:32.483
Kathy Najimy, and Bette Middler.

00:06:32.483 --> 00:06:35.903
These three played the iconic witch sisters
that were brought back from the dead to the

00:06:35.903 --> 00:06:39.643
modern day in the original, and Disney is
clearly happy to have them back.

00:06:39.643 --> 00:06:44.383
It seems like a safe bet that this will be
scheduled for release in October 2022, but

00:06:44.383 --> 00:06:48.620
as of now, only a "Fall 2022" window has been
announced.

00:06:49.033 --> 00:06:53.533
Before the release of Guardians of the Galaxy
Vol. 3 in 2023, James Gunn is gracing the

00:06:53.533 --> 00:06:55.843
world with even more Guardians content.

00:06:55.843 --> 00:07:00.383
Announced for late 2022, The Guardians of
the Galaxy Holiday Special will serve as a

00:07:00.383 --> 00:07:04.703
festive interlude between Thor: Love and Thunder
and Guardians Vol. 3.

00:07:04.703 --> 00:07:08.673
Of course, a Christmas special might bring
to mind such glorious flops as the Star Wars

00:07:08.673 --> 00:07:12.913
Holiday Special, and it probably won't put
anyone at ease to hear that Gunn claims he

00:07:12.913 --> 00:07:16.173
"unironically loved" that much-maligned program
as a kid.

00:07:16.173 --> 00:07:20.653
Still, considering Gunn's track record of
spinning straw into gold, it's probably fair

00:07:20.653 --> 00:07:23.733
to say that the Guardians Holiday Special
is in good hands.

00:07:24.733 --> 00:07:29.323
The Star Wars prequel series Andor is a spinoff
of Rogue One, following Diego Luna's rebel

00:07:29.323 --> 00:07:33.923
pilot Cassian Andor as he finds his calling
in the fight against the Empire.

00:07:33.923 --> 00:07:38.643
Star Wars: Andor will be set between Episodes
III and IV, approximately five years before

00:07:38.643 --> 00:07:40.193
the events of Rogue One.

00:07:40.193 --> 00:07:45.353
The series has been touted as a spy thriller,
taking Star Wars into genre territory it hasn't

00:07:45.353 --> 00:07:47.013
explored much in the past.

00:07:47.013 --> 00:07:51.252
Aside from Luna, the show is set to feature
Genevieve O'Reilly, with an appearance from

00:07:51.252 --> 00:07:54.033
Stellan Skarsgård promised for at least one
episode.

00:07:54.033 --> 00:07:58.043
Andor will hit Disney+ sometime in 2022.

00:07:58.043 --> 00:08:02.883
In the current Marvel Comics universe, the
hugely popular character Kamala Khan is better

00:08:02.883 --> 00:08:07.363
known as Ms. Marvel — and while some know
her as the protagonist of the 2020 Marvel's

00:08:07.363 --> 00:08:11.593
Avengers video game, she has yet to appear
in the MCU.

00:08:11.593 --> 00:08:16.373
In her live-action debut, Kamala will be played
by Iman Vellani, a relatively unknown Pakistani

00:08:16.373 --> 00:08:17.373
actor.

00:08:17.373 --> 00:08:22.183
Vellani has also been cast in the 2023 MCU
feature film The Marvels, which will pair

00:08:22.183 --> 00:08:27.462
up Kamala with Carol Danvers and Monica Rambeau,
serving as a sequel to both this series and

00:08:27.462 --> 00:08:29.343
the original Captain Marvel.

00:08:29.343 --> 00:08:32.854
Ms. Marvel is due out some time in 2022.

00:08:33.303 --> 00:08:34.303
"Hello there."

00:08:34.303 --> 00:08:38.983
If you are a Star Wars fan of any sort, you've
probably been hearing rumors about an Obi-Wan

00:08:38.983 --> 00:08:40.553
Kenobi series for a while.

00:08:40.553 --> 00:08:44.803
Well, it looks like everyone's patience has
finally paid off, because Obi-Wan Kenobi will

00:08:44.803 --> 00:08:48.013
be premiering on Disney+ in 2022.

00:08:48.013 --> 00:08:52.603
Ewan McGregor is set to reprise his role as
the legendary Jedi, joined by Hayden Christensen

00:08:52.603 --> 00:08:58.253
as Anakin Skywalker, as well as Joel Edgerton
and Bonnie Piesse as Uncle Owen and Aunt Beru.

00:08:58.253 --> 00:09:02.623
Not a ton of details are known outside of
the principal casting, but we do know that

00:09:02.623 --> 00:09:07.323
Obi-Wan Kenobi will be set approximately a
decade after the events of Revenge of the

00:09:07.323 --> 00:09:08.323
Sith.

00:09:08.323 --> 00:09:12.043
Perhaps most excitingly of all, however, is
the show's promise to feature a long-awaited

00:09:12.043 --> 00:09:14.123
rematch between Kenobi and Darth Vader.

00:09:15.123 --> 00:09:18.753
If you thought the Cars franchise had reached
the end of the road, think again.

00:09:18.753 --> 00:09:23.142
While a potential fourth movie is still up
in the air, Pixar's kid-friendly Cars franchise

00:09:23.142 --> 00:09:27.113
is finally returning with a Disney+ series
in 2022.

00:09:27.113 --> 00:09:31.193
Cars on the Road takes Lightning McQueen on
a brand new trip around the world of Cars.

00:09:31.193 --> 00:09:35.503
The short description that Disney has offered
suggests it's a kind of road trip story starring

00:09:35.503 --> 00:09:40.553
Lightning and Mater, and one that will easily
lend itself to any number of one-off stories

00:09:40.553 --> 00:09:42.453
and fun side characters.

00:09:42.453 --> 00:09:46.593
If nothing else, hopefully Cars on the Road
can recapture the magic that turned Cars into

00:09:46.593 --> 00:09:48.413
a major Pixar franchise.

00:09:49.413 --> 00:09:53.643
Zootopia may have been a critical darling,
but a sequel failed to materialize after its

00:09:53.643 --> 00:09:55.593
2016 box office run.

00:09:55.593 --> 00:10:01.253
Instead, Disney+ is taking this anthropomorphic
series to a more experimental place with Zootopia+,

00:10:01.253 --> 00:10:05.193
a series of animated shorts set in the world
of the movie.

00:10:05.193 --> 00:10:09.783
The series will revisit familiar characters
from the film, as well as establish new ones.

00:10:09.783 --> 00:10:14.043
The first look Disney shared on Twitter shows
the first movie's lead characters Judy Hopps

00:10:14.043 --> 00:10:18.773
and Nick Wilde joined by a cast of animals
from throughout the Zootopia universe.

00:10:18.773 --> 00:10:23.003
Unfortunately, Disney has been pretty pokey
about nailing down a specific premiere date

00:10:23.003 --> 00:10:27.702
for Zootopia+ — at this point, it's only
known that it will debut on Disney+ at some

00:10:27.702 --> 00:10:29.702
point in 2022.

00:10:29.702 --> 00:10:34.853
Based on an original idea that director George
Lucas dreamed up before Star Wars, the original

00:10:34.853 --> 00:10:39.273
Willow movie was developed after he took a
long break from that particular franchise.

00:10:39.273 --> 00:10:43.483
Directed by Ron Howard and starring Warwick
Davis as Willow, the movie was sadly met with

00:10:43.483 --> 00:10:47.193
an apathetic response from critics and theatergoers
alike.

00:10:47.193 --> 00:10:51.873
Nevertheless, Willow attracted a sizable cult
following over the decades following its release,

00:10:51.873 --> 00:10:54.593
and now it's back — with some familiar faces
attached.

00:10:54.593 --> 00:10:59.013
Warwick Davis is returning as Willow, and
Ron Howard is an executive producer on the

00:10:59.013 --> 00:11:00.013
project.

00:11:00.013 --> 00:11:03.983
The pilot is being helmed by In the Heights
director John M. Chu and is set for release

00:11:03.983 --> 00:11:06.087
in 2022.

00:11:06.303 --> 00:11:10.233
Believe it or not, that's not all that you
can expect to see on Disney+ in 2022.

00:11:10.233 --> 00:11:15.593
You can also expect more MCU stories like
"Moon Knight," "She-Hulk," and "Secret Invasion."

00:11:15.593 --> 00:11:20.233
Meanwhile, "Star Wars" fans will likely see
a third season of "The Mandalorian," a second

00:11:20.233 --> 00:11:22.493
season of "The Bad Batch," and more.

00:11:22.493 --> 00:11:26.973
No matter what you're into, it's an exciting
time to be signed up for Disney+.

00:11:26.973 --> 00:11:29.163
Check out one of our newest videos right here!

00:11:29.163 --> 00:11:34.053
Plus, even more Looper videos about your favorite
movies and TV shows are coming soon.

00:11:34.053 --> 00:11:38.253
Subscribe to our YouTube channel and hit the
bell so you don't miss a single one.

